   22: | `packets/combat/` | `AttackSwingPackets` | `SMSG_ATTACKSWING_NOTINRANGE`, `SMSG_ATTACKSWING_BADFACING` and `SMSG_CANCEL_COMBAT`, from the swing out of reach, the swing facing away and the attack cancelled; no payload |
   23: | `packets/entities/` | `CurrencyPackets` | `SMSG_SET_CURRENCY` (three bits, then the season count if sent, the total, the id and the week count if sent), `SMSG_SET_CURRENCY_WEEK_LIMIT` (the limit, then the id), `SMSG_WEEKLY_RESET_CURRENCIES` (no payload) and `SMSG_SEND_CURRENCIES` (the count and each currency's bits, then each currency's values), from `CurrencyMgr`'s count changed, week limit, weekly reset and every currency |
